{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233800","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233800","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423380001:1":{"text":"긴장이요... 약간요. 하지만 기대되는 게 더 커요.","source_cn":"紧张吗……是有一点，不过更多的是期待吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01FDECBC1A1C7124","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423380002:1":{"text":"아이들의 눈을 보고 있으면 제가 올바른 선택을 했다고 느낄 수 있으니까요.","source_cn":"看着那些孩子的眼睛，我明白我做出了正确的选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF22BBB4A55D5DF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423380003:1":{"text":"처음 수업할 때는 조금 서투를 수도 있겠지만, 사랑과 인내심이 모든 것을 더 좋게 만들 거라고 믿어요.","source_cn":"或许一开始上课的时候我有些笨拙，但我相信，爱和耐心能让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF646D47B77178C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423380004:1":{"text":"그리고 이곳은... 따뜻해요. 마치 제가 있어야 할 곳을 찾은 것 같아요.","source_cn":"更何况，这里……让我觉得温暖，像是找到了属于自己的地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x093BA67418A6878D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}